    {
      "version_id": "走-meaning-v1",
      "item_id": "走-meaning",
      "kind": "meaning",
      "version_no": 1,
      "payload": {
        "text": "古汉语中“走”的本义是跑、奔跑，如“走马观花”；今义“步行”是后起的。"
      },
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "source_id": "SRC-003",
          "note": "《说文》：走，趋也"
        },
        {
          "source_id": "SRC-004",
          "note": "今义对照"
        }
      ],
      "author": "内容组",
      "state": "已发布",
      "review": {
        "reviewer": "外聘文字学专家",
        "note": ""
      },
      "fingerprint": "6c43272343904689"
    },
    {
      "version_id": "走-expr-plain-v1",
      "item_id": "走-expr-plain",
      "kind": "expression",
      "version_no": 1,
      "payload": {
        "text": "三千年前，“走”是奔跑的意思。古人看到快跑的人，就画下了这个字。",
        "age_band": "7-9"
      },
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "source_id": "SRC-003",
          "note": "释义依据"
        },
        {
          "source_id": "SRC-006",
          "note": "适龄改写依据"
        }
      ],
      "author": "内容组",
      "state": "已发布",
      "review": {
        "reviewer": "外聘文字学专家",
        "note": ""
      },
      "fingerprint": "493382002d08a752"
    },
    {
      "version_id": "走-expr-story-v1",
      "item_id": "走-expr-story",
      "kind": "expression",
      "version_no": 1,
      "payload": {
        "text": "看这个字，像不像一个人甩开手臂大步跑？古时候“走”就是“快跑”哦！",
        "age_band": "4-6"
      },
      "source_refs": [
